      "id": "jbls-headphones-that-are-great-for-in-flight-entertainment-are-6",
      "title": "A JBL Flagship Headphone Takes A Deep Black Friday Cut",
      "kicker": "TECH // GEAR",
      "category": "tech",
      "subtopic": "guides",
      "author": "Devon Brooks",
